  "_comment": [
    "KapeAnalyser detection rules. Loaded at start of each run from rules.json next to KapeAnalyser.WPF.exe.",
    "Edit freely: comments (// ...) and trailing commas are allowed. Patterns are .NET regular expressions, matched case-insensitively.",
    "severity: Critical, High, Medium or Suspicious. Analyst keywords and whitelisted paths are set in the Detection panel instead.",
    "web*: IIS and Tomcat access log rules (webAttacks first match wins; webCommandParam needs a (?<cmd>...) group). suspiciousDomains: browser history and downloads, matched on the host name."
